          "id": "column-38",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "text-40",
              "kind": "text",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 2,
                  "text": "Military Airframes"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Titanium’s desirable characteristics and excellent strength to weight ratio make it an ideal material for structural airframe applications that include wing structures, landing gear components, critical fasteners, springs, and hydraulic tubing. For the past 50 years, Titanium used in airframes has grown significantly from it’s beginning in military programs."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Structural components of these airframes include forged wing structures, landing gear parts and components, fasteners, springs, hydraulic tubing, and much more."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Titanium used in these applications is due to these specific properties:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "high strength-to-weight ratio"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "high reliability"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "excellent corrosion resistance"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "desirable mechanical properties"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "protection against thermal expansion"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "column-39",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "picture-41",
              "kind": "picture",
              "src": "https://titanium.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/Airframe-1030x582.png",
